# Agent orchestration

This rule is engineering method only. It is not Product Truth and not a delivery roadmap.

Complex, multi-file, or unclear work starts in Plan Mode. That is a preference, not a claim that a rule can flip the IDE.

Independent research uses readonly subagents. Shared product code has one writer.

UI or runtime claims need the Browser and the repository tests. High-risk work also asks `workos-red-team`.

When Cursor or tool APIs change, read current official docs. Do not rely on memory.

Reports are evidence. They are not Owner acceptance.

Do not launch an agent swarm for appearance. Do not duplicate the existing e2e-first, one-truth, boundaries, technical-settings, canonical-direction, or operator-ui rules.
